[00:10.57] Time passed hard,
[00:15.01] And the task was the hardest thing she'd ever do.
[00:23.45] But she forgot,
[00:27.98] The moment she saw you.
[00:35.03] So it would seem to be true:
[00:40.89] When cruel birth debases, we forget.
[00:46.15] When cruel death debases,
[00:51.76] We believe it erases all the rest
[00:57.61] That precedes.
[01:01.98] But stand brave, life-liver,
[01:08.77] Bleeding out your days
[01:11.50] In the river of time.
[01:17.31] Stand brave:
[01:22.60] Time moves both ways,
[01:28.42] In the nullifying, defeating, negating, repeating
[01:35.69] Joy of life;
[01:41.96] The nullifying, defeating, negating, repeating
[01:48.82] Joy of life.
[01:56.03] The moment of your greatest joy sustains:
[02:02.85] Not axe nor hammer,
[02:04.80] Tumor, tremor,
[02:06.21] Can take it away, and it remains.
[02:15.15] It remains.
[02:22.00] And it pains me to say, I was wrong.
[02:36.44] Love is not a symptom of time.
[02:43.32] Time is just a symptom of love
[02:49.57] (And the nullifying, defeating, negating, repeating
[02:56.21] Joy of life;
[03:02.53] The nullifying, defeating, negating, repeating
[03:08.92] Joy of life).
[03:13.93] Hardly seen, hardly felt–
[03:16.21] Deep down where your fight is waiting,
[03:18.84] Down 'till the light in your eyes is fading:
[03:22.08] Joy of life.
[03:28.00] Where i know that you can yield, when it comes down to it;
[03:31.68] Bow like the field when the combs through it:
[03:35.38] Joy of life.
[03:41.25] And every little gust that chances through
[03:44.34] Will dance in the dust of me and you,
[03:48.19] With joy-of-life.
[03:54.04] And in our perfect secret-keeping:
[03:57.31] One ear of corn,
[03:58.99] In silent, reaping
[04:01.35] Joy of life.
[04:13.72] A way a lone a last a loved a long.
[04:19.13] A cave, a grave, a day: arise, ascend.
[04:24.64] (Areion, Rharian, go free and graze. Amen.)
[04:31.18] A shore, a tide, unmoored–a sight, abroad:
[04:36.84] A dawn, unmarked, undone, undarked (a god).
[04:42.79] No time. No flock. No chime, no clock. No end.
[04:48.44] White star, white ship–Nightjar, transmit: transcend!
[04:53.64] White star, white ship–Nightjar, transmit: transcend!
[04:58.89] White star, white ship–Nightjar, transmit: transcend!
[05:04.79] White star, white ship–Nightjar, transmit: trans
